  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Women Democratic governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the present phase 2 of the programme is to improve the governance of delivery of basic public services and goods to poor women in Marocco, Tadsjikistan and Rwanda with a particular focus on reform on local level.  An important aim is to build capacity and competence of women  in order to identify and document efficient tools to promote women&#x2019;s rights and gender equality. Implementation of the programme will represent an important initiative for integrating a gender perspective in the field of democracy and good governance, an important precondition for the empowerment of women, economic development and the eradication of poverty.</narrative>
  </description>
